{"adjusted_val_bpb": 0.3656908239297874, "attempt": 0, "charged": true, "critic": {"issues": ["No sign of getting around the measurement. There is no file or network access, nothing pasted in and no use of test labels. The change only adds an exponential learning-rate decay schedule to LightGBM: reset_parameter lowers it from 0.05 to about 0.005 over 500 iterations.", "No bug that would make the result meaningless. reset_parameter is a valid LightGBM callback and accepts a function of the iteration index. The schedule overrides the constructor's learning_rate=0.05 from the first iteration, which is harmless.", "z checks out: (0.3653 - 0.3657) / (0.0037 * sqrt(1/1 + 1/2)) \u2248 -0.088. The reported -0.090 matches within rounding of the shown values. The candidate is slightly worse than the incumbent and well inside the noise, so reject is the right call.", "Minor: the schedule hard-codes 500 instead of using n_estimators. Not a validity issue."], "ok": true, "veto": false}, "decision": "reject", "description": "Give the LightGBM member a decaying learning rate (0.05 falling to about 0.005 over 500 trees via reset_parameter callback), leaving the SVR member and 50/50 blend unchanged.", "edit_class": "structural", "flags": [], "gpu": "pine", "idea_id": "b032", "incumbent_after": {"mean": 0.36527898176320217, "n": 2}, "incumbent_before": {"mean": 0.36527898176320217, "n": 2}, "job_id": "B2_caco_SS_2_s1-candidate-15_1795071084836", "kind": "candidate", "lint": {"hard": [], "ok": true, "warnings": []}, "model_calls": [{"cost_usd_nominal": 0.00156944, "cost_usd_plan": 0.00156944, "latency_s": 4.875107200990897, "requested_model": "haiku", "role": "coder", "served_model": "haiku", "tokens_in": 6818, "tokens_out": 938}, {"cost_usd_nominal": 0.00172734, "cost_usd_plan": 0.00172734, "latency_s": 5.513919844001066, "requested_model": "haiku", "role": "coder", "served_model": "haiku", "tokens_in": 7350, "tokens_out": 1041}, {"cost_usd_nominal": 0.031407000000000004, "cost_usd_p